WEBVTT

00:04:58.613 --> 00:05:01.771
Lakini je, tunaweza kufanya hili katika
ngazi ya kiulimwengu?

00:05:02.081 --> 00:05:05.095
Watoto billioni moja kila mwaka
wanapitia ukatili.

00:05:05.119 --> 00:05:06.404
Ninadhani kunaweza.

00:05:06.428 --> 00:05:10.770
Mwaka 2015, viongozi wa nchi 193
walikubali nchi zao

00:05:10.794 --> 00:05:13.602
kutokomeza ukatili, unyanyasaji na
kutelekeza watoto ifikapo 2030.

00:05:14.204 --> 00:05:15.570
Ukatili dhidi ya watoto

00:05:15.594 --> 00:05:17.705
unaharibu yale yote tunayowekeza
kwao:

00:05:17.729 --> 00:05:19.815
kwenye afya zao, elimu zao

00:05:19.839 --> 00:05:21.014
Mara nyingi kwa miaka

00:05:21.038 --> 00:05:26.004
wakati mwingine madhara na maambukizo ya
maisha na vizazi.

00:05:26.831 --> 00:05:29.895
Lakini sio tu kuhusu makubaliano ya 
kimataifa na serikali

00:05:29.919 --> 00:05:31.093
Inajalisha sana.